A||||10||Fformula88||Celica GTS ricers sure are annoying!||||1||
Z||000000||Fformula88||11-26-2001||12:49 PM||||This is the second time I have had an encounter with a ricer like this:<P>Saturday night I am cruising on a 4 lane road in a fairly rural area.  (Transit road up in Niagara County for the local members).  Its 45, so I am doing about 50 since the road is patrolled by State Troopers all the time.  Then a silver Celica GTS passes me, not going too much faster than I am.  It looked mostly stock except possibly new rims... they looked a bit big for stock.  Then I noticed the fart can out back.  It was actually the most expensive one I have seen, but it did stick 8 inches ut past the rear bumper and had to be at least 5 inches in diameter!  <P>Then he slows down to pull next to me.  goes slightly behind me then speeds up fast to just ahead of me and slows again.  He does this a couple times trying to get me to go.<P>One I wouldn't race somebody starting at 50 anyway.  I just feel its insane.  Second, I know the GTS makes all its power above 6000 RPM's.  My Auto V6 will shift to 3rd not too far north of 50 under full throttle, and there isn't much acceleration there.  No way I could be close much above fifty.  So I shook my head no and he continued on his way.<P>Whats odd is this happened to me about a week ago... that ricer was a similarly modded Integra.  <P>Are the ricers and their fart cans getting smarter?  I know its hard to believe, but I have never been challenged by either type of car at a light (Saturns are another story  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">) but they all wnat to run after they are moving.  They must finally be coming to the realization that they actually do NOT have any low-end torque.<P>Anyone else been having ricers wanting to race when they are already doing a good clip?<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/formulasig.JPG">         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">   <P>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
Z||000001||DR650SE||11-26-2001||02:12 PM||||Same happens to me once in a while.  Once though, I was doing about 60mph and a riced out honda all modded out came up next to me and whent back and forth to race.  I went up to 90mph and then ended the race there.  I had beaten it but don't want another ticket.<P>------------------<BR>AIM:  DR650SE<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DR650SEsig2.gif"> ||||reg||6
Z||000002||Standard||11-26-2001||02:40 PM||||I never get them challenging me on the highway... then again,  I still have enough torque to take 'em from a light, too.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
